;; gov-revenue-corpus.jp.edn — pre-published `com.etzhayyim.gov.dataset.*Record` corpus (danjo G3).
;;
;; This is the PASSIVE INGEST input: a flat list of already-public, IPFS-pinnable government
;; records in the canonical `gov.dataset` record shape (field names mirror danjo's
;; budget_ledger.py `normalize_record`, EDN-keyed). `ingest.clj` projects these → the revenue
;; model (`{:accounts :revenue-lines :transfers :outlays}`) that `revenue_ledger.clj` consumes.
;;
;; danjo NEVER fetches a live portal (G3); the corpus IS the input. Each record carries its own
;; deterministic content CID downstream (G5). `:record-kind` ∈ {:revenue :transfer :appropriation
;; :outlay}. The account-EARMARK structure is NOT a record here — it is accounting LAW
;; (特別会計法 / 復興財源確保法), encoded as a constant in ingest.clj, not "fetched".
;;
;; All figures :representative (real 一般会計 / 復興特別会計 structure; G7 live-verification pending).
;; Aggregate / program-level endpoints only. NOT an authoritative budget statement.

